PQ&oe=69DBAEB7"}, {"file_name": "Frame 438.png", "id": "1506206500038599", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974632_1506206503371932_1010687020742680659_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Cb5FZb1NjzUQ7kNvwGnb0st&_nc_oc=Ado_GeoyJS2mP34biSG6gGXvR6S6ZXwItlFUfqVCzS734l7AaJPv5PKdt6wXnvHSek8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0m78_Dqt-JHcBnP7nH_8sZOpvcQnw4PsL6p8MoFwSpxw&oe=69DBB19E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Patient Examination Pro", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Pre-Configured Scenarios:\n\nVarious clinical cases covering common and rare conditions.\nScenarios range in complexity to suit different expertise levels, from medical students to seasoned professionals.\n\nPatient Interaction:\n\nVirtual patients with realistic symptoms, behaviors, and histories.\nDynamic responses to user actions, such as questions during history-taking or physical examination maneuvers.\n\nExamination Tools:\n\nVirtual stethoscopes, and other diagnostic tools to simulate physical exams.\nIntegration of digital pathology tools, allowing for skin examinations, and more.\n\nLab Analysis and Imaging:\n\nAccess to virtual lab results (e.g., CBC, LFT, urinalysis).\nSimulated radiology imaging tools (e.g., X-rays, CT scans, MRI) with real-time interpretation options.\n\nReal-Time Feedback and Evaluation:\n\nAutomated feedback on diagnosis and decision-making.\n\nCustomization:\n\nLooking for more - contact us with your curriculum requirements!", "short_description": "The platform provides immersive, pre-configured clinical scenarios where learners interact with virtual patients to practice history-taking, physical exams, lab analysis, and imaging interpretation. Using realistic tools and dynamic feedback, users develop diagnostic and decision-making skills while educators can customize cases and track performance. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_u